who underwent unilateral nephrectomy in childhood</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>1985</year><volume>i</volume><fpage>1277</fpage><lpage>1299</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Lancet||i|1277||bib19|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sanchez de Toledo</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Martinez</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Ibanez</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Castello</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Moreno</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Vinas</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Enriquez</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Perez</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Renal function study in 40 survived Wilms' tumour patients</article-title><source>Med Pediatr Oncol</source><year>1989</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>318</fpage>(abstract 155)<!--PubMed citation query: 'Med Pediatr Oncol||17|318||bib20|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Task Force</collab></person-group><article-title>Report of the second task force on blood pressure control in children &#x02013; 1987</article-title><source>Pediatrics</source><year>1987</year><volume>79</volume><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>25</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Pediatrics||79|1||bib21|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3797155</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Walker</surname><given-names>RD</given-names></name><name><surname>Reid</surname><given-names>FC</given-names></name><name><surname>Richard</surname><given-names>GA</given-names></name><name><surname>Talbert</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name><name><surname>Rodgers</sur